The "How Loud Can You Scream" Challenge.

00:02:09.920 --> 00:02:10.920
AHHHHHHHHHHHHH!

00:02:10.920 --> 00:02:14.360
The "Apologize For Something While You're
Doing It" Challenge.

00:02:14.360 --> 00:02:17.540
I don't dislike challenge videos, I actually
quite like them; I think they're fun, and

00:02:17.540 --> 00:02:21.770
